#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/art/artbyaddae/cattails-in-hurricane-season/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cattails in Hurricane season"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/artbyaddae/cattails-in-hurricane-season/index.en.md
msgid ""
"It is the Early to mid summer in Southeastern Virginia during hurricane "
"season. In order to prepare, members of the community would forage for "
"edible and medicinal plants ready to harvest. They would split off into "
"groups of two or three based on whatever edible plant they were supposed to "
"find. Each person carries a zine that helps with Identifying the plants they "
"are looking for."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/artbyaddae/cattails-in-hurricane-season/index.en.md
msgid "In this scene, these two are looking for cattails."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/artbyaddae/cattails-in-hurricane-season/index.en.md
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Other notes/elements included:"
msgid "Plants included:"
msgstr "Other notes/elements included:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/artbyaddae/cattails-in-hurricane-season/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Oaks, Pines, and sycamores in the background as well as cattails and "
"pickerelweed."
msgstr ""

