"energy generation. [[Read More](https://iopscience.iop.org/"
"article/10.1088/1755-1315/362/1/012106)]"
msgstr ""
"Since [higher-density cities are more sustainable](https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Urban_density#Sustainability), Solarpunk futures can see a lot of "
"suburbs dismantled and the land given back to nature - or used for renewable "
"energy generation. [[Read More](https://iopscience.iop.org/"
"article/10.1088/1755-1315/362/1/012106)]"

