#, no-wrap
msgid "Emergency Wind Power Generation Unit"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/scandinavian101/emergency-wind-power-generation-unit/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Following a tsunami, the affected community is slowly gathering and "
"rebuilding, but to provide immediate power supply, this unit was deployed. "
"Several floating power turbines(with colorful schemes painted by their "
"crews) are connected to a mobile battery unit, which then provides power to "
"the community. A camp for the displaced people and a several basic medical "
"facilities are directly receiving the power."
msgstr ""

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/art/scandinavian101/grain-train-sketch/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sustainable Farming - Grain Train - Sketch"
msgstr "Odżywalne rolnictwo - pociąg ze zbożem - szkic"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/scandinavian101/grain-train-sketch/index.en.md
msgid ""
"A sketch of a sustainable future - a train filled with small containers with "
"food from local farming cooperatives."
msgstr ""
"Szkic z odżywalnej przyszłości - pociąg wypełniony małymi kontenerami z "
"żywnością z lokalnych kooperatyw rolniczych."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/scandinavian101/grain-train-sketch/index.en.md
msgid ""
"It was used by [alxd](/authors/alxd) in his [Lenses and Foundations essay]"
"(https://alxd.org/solarpunk-lenses-and-foundations.html) to illustrate how "
"hard it is to explain actual sustainable practices on an infrastructural "
"scale without symbols encoded in the culture."
msgstr ""
"Ilustracja została użyta przez [alxd](/pl/authors/alxd) w jego eseju "
"[Soczewki i Fundamenty](https://soczewki.alxd.org/) aby pokazać jak trudno "
"jest pokazać rzeczywiste odżywalne praktyki i procesy nie mając odpowiednich "
"symboli zakodowanych już w kulturze."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/art/scandinavian101/lifeboat-library/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Lifeboat Library"
msgstr "Szalupa Biblioteczna"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/scandinavian101/lifeboat-library/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Depicted is a settlement built on the remnants of an old, coastal town. The "
"focal point is a lifeboat converted into a floating library. It serves as a "
"way of cultural exchange between surrounding communities and a window into "
"the world. This evening people gathered together to watch a movie screened "
"on the boat's sail."
msgstr ""
"Ilustracja przedstawia osadę zbudowaną na ruinach starego miasta na "
"wybrzeżu. Centralnym punktem jest szalupa ratunkowa przerobiona na "
"pływającą bibliotekę, służącą jako kulturowy łącznik między pobliskimi "
"społecznościami i ich okno na świat. Tego wieczoru społeczność zgromadziła "
"się, by obejrzeć film wyświetlany na żaglach."

