#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Solarpunk Anarchy"
msgstr "Solarpunkowa anarchia"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"[Original on Patreon](https://www.patreon.com/posts/solarpunk-with-103968472)"
msgstr ""
"[Oryginał na Patreonie](https://www.patreon.com/posts/solarpunk-"
"with-103968472)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"One of my heroes Charlie Munger said that \"If you don't destroy one of your "
"most closely held ideas each year, then you're not learning enough.\""
msgstr ""
"One of my heroes Charlie Munger said that \"If you don't destroy one of your "
"most closely held ideas each year, then you're not learning enough.\""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Well, I've learned a lot by listening to Andrew Sage on his YouTube channel: "
"https://www.youtube.com/@Andrewism"
msgstr ""
"Well, I've learned a lot by listening to Andrew Sage on his YouTube channel: "
"https://www.youtube.com/@Andrewism"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"(FYI We collaborated on a previous piece about [How to Build a Solarpunk "
"City](/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-city/).)"
msgstr ""
"(FYI We collaborated on a previous piece about [How to Build a Solarpunk "
"City](/pl/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-city/).)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"First off, I had a blast creating this vibrant picture with Andrew. I hope "
"you enjoy the close up details and I'll share the process down below :)"
msgstr ""
"First off, I had a blast creating this vibrant picture with Andrew. I hope "
"you enjoy the close up details and I'll share the process down below :)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"But first, Anarchy, or Free Association as he describes in the video that "
"this picture is for,"
msgstr ""
"But first, Anarchy, or Free Association as he describes in the video that "
"this picture is for,"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Without getting too complex, I started asking myself \"What would make Free "
"Association/Anarchy really possible\""
msgstr ""
"Without getting too complex, I started asking myself \"What would make Free "
"Association/Anarchy really possible\""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid "Since I already believe that:"
msgstr "Since I already believe that:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid "A. People are inherently collaborative overall"
msgstr "A. People are inherently collaborative overall"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid "B. Trust is a key part of human nature,"
msgstr "B. Trust is a key part of human nature,"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid "C. Creativity emerges from combinations of freedom and constraints:"
msgstr "C. Creativity emerges from combinations of freedom and constraints:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"With that said, I believe that governments are formed as the path of least "
"resistance to solve all of the problems we face. Most governments aren't "
"created on the spot, they evolve over a long time. There are also many many "
"people who would gladly sacrifice freedom for security."
msgstr ""
"With that said, I believe that governments are formed as the path of least "
"resistance to solve all of the problems we face. Most governments aren't "
"created on the spot, they evolve over a long time. There are also many many "
"people who would gladly sacrifice freedom for security."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"So thinking on this, I believe that the most free societies will be possible "
"in:"
msgstr ""
"So thinking on this, I believe that the most free societies will be possible "
"in:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid "A nearly scarcity-free world"
msgstr "A nearly scarcity-free world"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid "A rewards based society, very little punishment, very good rewards."
msgstr "A rewards based society, very little punishment, very good rewards."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Both of these ideas tie into Solarpunk. I believe humanity's ability to "
"survive climate change is linked to our ability to problem solve creatively "
"and collaboratively, under pressure."
msgstr ""
"Both of these ideas tie into Solarpunk. I believe humanity's ability to "
"survive climate change is linked to our ability to problem solve creatively "
"and collaboratively, under pressure."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"That's it! I don't have any solutions of how to get there, but I really "
"enjoyed thinking about these topics and I've definitely changed my mind on "
"Anarchy more than I expected to."
msgstr ""
"That's it! I don't have any solutions of how to get there, but I really "
"enjoyed thinking about these topics and I've definitely changed my mind on "
"Anarchy more than I expected to."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/art/sean-bodley/solarpunk-anarchy/index.en.md
msgid ""
"Thanks again to Andrew for inspiring the work and art directing throughout."
msgstr ""
"Thanks again to Andrew for inspiring the work and art directing throughout."

